body:
Additions in this mod:

v1.1

A search field has been added to the librarian villager's interface to search for enchanted books.

v1.0

Right-click on a card to own it;
A notebook for managing sales, purchases, and withdrawals;
Banknotes of 5, 10, 20, 50, 100, and 200;
Right-click on banknotes deposits them into the account balance;
Recipes for banknotes;
Charcoal block;
Recipe for saddle and nametag;
Arrow recipe is now made with feather and stick, returning 4 arrows;
Villagers sell all trades for one emerald and display all trades at once.

Questions or Suggestions? Join our Discord: http://discord.gg/YFP522kYtM.
